# ---- Data ----
# Raw downloads (nemosis/nemseer zips + CSVs, monthly AEMO files, PREDISPATCH runs) are large and
# re-fetchable, so they live in data/cache/. The small, typed VIC1 parquet extracts in data/raw/ and
# data/processed/ ARE committed so the backtest, CI and the dashboard run without network access.
data/cache/

# ---- Deep-learning checkpoints ----
*.ckpt
lightning_logs/

